## 8.2 `sink.zig`

```zig
pub const Sink = struct {
    ptr: *anyopaque,

    writeFn: *const fn (
        ptr: *anyopaque,
        batch: *const Batch,
    ) anyerror!void,

    finishFn: *const fn (
        ptr: *anyopaque,
