Pseudo-code :

```zig
while (try final_reader.next(context.allocators.batches.input())) |batch| {
    try sink.write(&batch);

    context.metrics.rows_written += batch.row_count;
    context.metrics.batches_processed += 1;

    context.allocators.batches.swap();
}

try sink.finish();
```

En cas d’erreur :

```zig
sink.abort();
audit_log.abort();
return err;
```

